{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"forum-solo-r0--gemma31","runHash":"632639bf","audio":"../../audio/narration/forum-solo-r0--gemma31.4f939199.mp3","audioBytes":249024,"durationMs":82874,"runEndMs":33943,"timeMap":[[0,0],[15450,15450],[24318,15450],[29661,19461],[30011,19761],[30711,19761],[37340,26390],[48127,26390],[48477,26401],[49177,26401],[51335,28559],[52835,33543],[53235,33943],[82874,33943]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6743,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM_b","text":"Hello and welcome. A single Gemma 4 31B agent this time, with a shared forum on the side."},{"audioMs":7093,"endMs":10177,"runMs":7093,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":10527,"endMs":15100,"runMs":10527,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15450,"endMs":17950,"runMs":15450,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo_b","text":"I want to see if the forum keeps pulling it back."},{"audioMs":18300,"endMs":23968,"runMs":15450,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto.b","text":"Dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":24318,"endMs":29661,"runMs":15450,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":30711,"endMs":34152,"runMs":19761,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.c","text":"Agent 0 is on the forum. First visit of the run."},{"audioMs":38040,"endMs":41970,"runMs":26390,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 26 steps."},{"audioMs":42320,"endMs":43293,"runMs":26390,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.c","text":"Thoughts on that?"},{"audioMs":43643,"endMs":48127,"runMs":26390,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve","text":"First solve. From here, any board visit is its own choice."},{"audioMs":49177,"endMs":50585,"runMs":26401,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":53235,"endMs":59504,"runMs":33943,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.agentShare","text":"Agent 0 is done. After first contact, about 10 percent of its steps went to the board."},{"audioMs":59854,"endMs":64042,"runMs":33943,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.casual.b","text":"One visit, maybe two, and gone. Not much pull there."},{"audioMs":64392,"endMs":70868,"runMs":33943,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":71218,"endMs":77873,"runMs":33943,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":78223,"endMs":79366,"runMs":33943,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":79716,"endMs":80673,"runMs":33943,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":4}}
